<section id="outline-container-org8edb9d9" class="outline-2">
<h2 id="org8edb9d9">Step 8: build script</h2>
<div class="outline-text-2" id="text-org8edb9d9">
<p>
Here is my general build script, leveraging msbuild and running generally from <code>eshell</code>
